<h2 local-id=3D"61877d9dda9e" id=3D"PaidInvoiceStatusSignalIntegrationforLi=
censeKeyFulfillmentinSalesforce-2.RequestSummary">2. Request Summary</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b=
b1f5c75-9942-46c2-a4ce-751766e704cd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4c7c9ea6-7294-49f2-8ea2-67bdf4306149">
<th data-local-id=3D"481cd781-857b-4c0c-8182-8171859827bc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"36e877e33542">Category</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"30b06baa-5d5a-4948-b14c-85e639e297c1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9da646abd868">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a055bf01-6a62-4c46-9bb7-2ee47571f7ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce2a2bed-6b8c-4601-9134-997992f3052f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c42a3475e23e">Business Need</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ca94798a-8535-4b4c-a4f2-0e3a7759db7e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf48617ffca3">Establish a reliable connection between =E2=80=
=9Cinvoice paid=E2=80=9D status from Workday and a Salesforce indicator (at=
 contract/order/asset level) so operations teams can identify what is ready=
 for license key delivery and record completion. <a class=3D"external-link"=
 href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_he=
lpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E=
6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesfor=
ce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[R=
enewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"84155b04-be84-4a72-822d-200020da56a9">
<td data-local-id=3D"48a5f695-ae74-4b2f-812c-109404c06bd4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d48354de336">Why This Is Needed Now</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c9fcc192-046e-4161-a58b-ea0d3cd38741" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6fac042f89e">Auto-renewal and invoice automation introduces=
 scenarios where Salesforce records (contracts/assets/orders) may be create=
d before payment is received; operations needs a paid/unpaid signal and wor=
kflow to prevent premature key delivery. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D=
"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystem=
s_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD50=
5AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&=
amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals =
R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"46842d17-503b-4561-828b-4858fadb4c7a">
<td data-local-id=3D"2d437365-f7cd-4666-958d-be77217aa768" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a58032f5e7b8">Who Is Impacted</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14079d7a-f686-4ec3-9594-2522831ff1f2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a372b073829">Customer Operations (Tech) for all tech-side i=
tems; Cyber Operations for specific auto-renewal brands (Offensive Security=
, Vulnerability Management, Clearswift). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D=
"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystem=
s_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD50=
5AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&=
amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals =
R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"59d8f2cc656f" id=3D"PaidInvoiceStatusSignalIntegrationforLi=
censeKeyFulfillmentinSalesforce-3.Scope">3. Scope</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2=
5f4016d-9602-4d9e-86ec-84d1085680d5" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fc7ad57c-0a71-4ce9-8be8-264a03068eb4">
<th data-local-id=3D"cf49c194-13a3-4f03-9442-8c67a3392d5a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e26979d5eb13">Scope Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1f39507c-ff7c-4783-9146-22e72306b7a2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2e7c20d0fd88">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7dbcbea7-3fc8-4aac-8b01-f118f238ab58">
<td data-local-id=3D"4d55aa3d-56ea-48ee-9442-b8ccd248ef32" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0808b7bf2354">In Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9a6fc26-4b1c-42e3-90ac-2f85ce357534" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4073f173ec77">Create a =E2=80=9Cpaid/unpaid=E2=80=9D indicat=
or and/or =E2=80=9Cpaid on=E2=80=9D timestamp in Salesforce (location to be=
 determined: contract/order/asset); enable list/report/dashboard views for =
paid changes; provide a user =E2=80=9Ccheck off=E2=80=9D mechanism to recor=
d that license keys were delivered. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http=
s://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com=
/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7=
D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;a=
ction=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...S=
alesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5570bd27-27eb-4a00-9d36-713eda2f255b">
<td data-local-id=3D"7d6b0bde-f298-4e0f-b9c0-a0ad51f01d78" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b156360ecf1">Out of Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a20305b4-4ea2-48d0-9073-b0c57dc31f52" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d7658e215e9">Full definition of how RevCloud artifacts are =
created/rolled back on cancel/rebill; complete MuleSoft cancellation/rebuil=
d synchronization design (not finalized in transcript). <a class=3D"externa=
l-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guen=
ther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98=
-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20S=
alesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofol=
low">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"dca9804af3e5" id=3D"PaidInvoiceStatusSignalIntegrationforLi=
censeKeyFulfillmentinSalesforce-4.FunctionalRequirements">4. Functional Req=
uirements</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"393cc034-dcef-4076-aa98-bec9d5158fbe">
<li local-id=3D"90540e5b-ea70-4a3e-a35f-cc6fd7d53348">
<p local-id=3D"c663a4a7346c"><strong>FR-1:</strong> The system must display=
 an <strong>invoice paid status</strong> in Salesforce using a clear indica=
tor (e.g., =E2=80=9CPaid/Unpaid=E2=80=9D) at a defined level (contract, ord=
er, or asset). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my=
.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx=
?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals=
%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;m=
obileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a>=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dce849cb-f500-448f-8683-6f3952f4d69d">
<p local-id=3D"42697d10efc4"><strong>FR-2:</strong> The system must support=
 capturing a <strong>timestamp</strong> (e.g., =E2=80=9CPaid On=E2=80=9D) w=
hen the status changes to paid, enabling filtering such as =E2=80=9Cpaid in=
 last X days.=E2=80=9D <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsyste=
msllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/=
Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3D=
Renewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefau=
lt&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | W=
ord]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6488a5a-f77d-400c-91b7-a39b4d9eec54">
<p local-id=3D"993a587e00a7"><strong>FR-3:</strong> The system must provide=
 a <strong>report/list/dashboard</strong> that enables teams to identify it=
ems that changed from unpaid to paid (or are now paid and pending fulfillme=
nt). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoin=
t.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=
=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Require=
ment%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredir=
ect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4237048-5282-4736-8cd5-3a7560e0bd93">
<p local-id=3D"85f3457693f1"><strong>FR-4:</strong> The system must provide=
 a mechanism for operations users to <strong>record completion</strong> of =
license key delivery (e.g., a checkbox/field such as =E2=80=9CKeys Delivere=
d=E2=80=9D). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.s=
harepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?s=
ourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%2=
0Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mob=
ileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a7a94844-52d7-47d0-81fd-06cf396a7b7a">
<p local-id=3D"4bb3568140f8"><strong>FR-5:</strong> The =E2=80=9Cpaid statu=
s + fulfillment check-off=E2=80=9D workflow must support Tech-side needs fo=
r <strong>all</strong> tech contracts (long term) and Cyber needs for <stro=
ng>auto-renewal brands</strong> specifically. <a class=3D"external-link" hr=
ef=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helps=
ystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B6=
4BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.=
docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Rene=
wals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"d8948caf745c" id=3D"PaidInvoiceStatusSignalIntegrationforLi=
censeKeyFulfillmentinSalesforce-5.BusinessRules">5. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"cb97d2da-bcef-4c0c-8936-5163a0dea929">
<li local-id=3D"432a031a-bb99-4da4-bb75-3c060b4f20f4">
<p local-id=3D"a178ebfe5b9c"><strong>BR-1:</strong> For operational usabili=
ty, the paid signal should be tracked at the <strong>contract or order leve=
l</strong> when a contract may include <strong>hundreds of assets</strong>,=
 to avoid per-asset check-offs. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://=
helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_la=
youts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&am=
p;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;actio=
n=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Sales=
force | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f68be3b2-9260-4f4d-8a2d-cfed594930a6">
<p local-id=3D"ed90239d1a43"><strong>BR-2:</strong> Tech-side operations re=
quires a workflow tied to payment for <strong>everything</strong> (excludin=
g current exceptions noted like GlobalScape, moving toward auto renewal). <=
a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/=
personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7B=
A844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%2=
0Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3D=
true" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9d8cb3d5-52e6-42ec-8c83-0668a1bc2321">
<p local-id=3D"585c0b5158d6"><strong>BR-3:</strong> Cyber operations requir=
es the paid/fulfillment tracking for <strong>auto-renewal brands</strong> (=
Offensive Security, Vulnerability Management, Clearswift). <a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_g=
uenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4=
A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%=
20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"no=
follow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
